xportSource":null}},{"_id":"H3RYLGqCiqm8BP3q","name":"生命领域 Life Domain","type":"subclass","img":"icons/magic/life/cross-yellow-green.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>生命领域专注于活跃的正能量，其既是组成宇宙的主能量之一，也是维持所有生命延续的基础。生命之神的神职就是恢复人们的健康和伤痛，照顾需要帮助者，同时对抗死亡和不死的力量。几乎所有的非邪恶神都可以宣称在这一领域有影响，特别是农业神（如裳A亚Chauntea、阿拉瓦依Arawai和德墨忒尔Demeter）、太阳神（洛山达Lathander、培罗Pelor和拉·赫拉克提Re-Horakhty）、医疗或者坚韧之神（如伊尔梅特Ilmater、米莎凯Mishakal、阿波罗Apollo和迪安斯彻特Diancecht）以及家庭和社会之神（如赫斯提亚Hestia，哈托尔Hathor和博得雷Boldrei）。</p><table><caption>生命领域法术</caption><thead><tr><td>牧师等级</td><td>法术</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1st</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.8dzaICjGy6mTUaUr]{祝福术}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.uUWb1wZgtMou0TVP]{疗伤术}</td></tr><tr><td>3rd</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.F0GsG0SJzsIOacwV]{次等复原术}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.JbxsYXxSOTZbf9I0]{灵体武器}</td></tr><tr><td>5th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.ZU9d6woBdUP8pIPt]{希望信标}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.LmRHHMtplpxr9fX6]{回生术}</td></tr><tr><td>7th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.VtCXMdyM6mAdIJZb]{防死结界}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.TgHsuhNasPbhu8MO]{信仰守卫}</td></tr><tr><td>9th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.Pyzmm8R7rVsNAPsd]{群体疗伤术}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.AGFMPAmuzwWO6Dfz]{死者复活}</td></tr></tbody></table>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"identifier":"life-domain","classIdentifier":"cleric","advancement":[{"_id":"bW7chouU8WIVH0Le","type":"Trait","configuration":{"mode":"default","allowReplacements":false,"grants":["armor:hvy"],"choices":[]},"level":1,"title":"","value":{"chosen":[]}},{"_id":"9fyr5t01nhdg0u8n","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.68bYIOvx6rIqnlOW","optional":false},{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.jF8AFfEMICIJnAkR","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":1,"title":"子职业特性"},{"_id":"4qh4ejxpwugva6ma","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.hEymt45rICi4f9eL","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":2,"title":"子职业特性"},{"_id":"ihquu4r80mxr07qt","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.yv49QN6Bzqs0ecCs","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":6,"title":"子职业特性"},{"_id":"ayh4gqp9vxjo9yd3","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.T6u5z8ZTX6UftXqE","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":8,"title":"子职业特性"},{"_id":"m4m8xp6cabt71mdq","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.4UOgxzr83vFuUash","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":17,"title":"子职业特性"},{"_id":"RYU9NFMQarGlfW23","type":"ScaleValue","configuration":{"identifier":"divine-strike","type":"dice","distance":{"units":""},"scale":{"8":{"number":1,"faces":8,"modifiers":[]},"14":{"number":2,"faces":8,"modifiers":[]}}},"value":{},"title":"神圣打击伤害"}],"spellcasting":{"progression":"none","ability":"","preparation":{}}},"effects":[],"folder":"m1NqJdyiVSU7ghF5","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"zzzz","m":"id"}},"_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.344","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"4.0.0","createdTime":1725037372837,"modifiedTime":1725992730577,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"name":"奉献之誓 Oath of Devotion","type":"subclass","img":"icons/magic/holy/saint-glass-portrait-halo.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>奉献之誓，意味着公正、美德、秩序的理念中最为崇高的一部分。这些圣武士通常被称为圣骑兵cavaliers、白骑士white knights或是圣战士holy warriors，他们是身披闪亮的盔甲的正派骑士形象代表，躬行着公正的教条，追寻崇高的目标。他们严于律己，某些成员甚至会过于严苛的对待他人。追随该誓言的许多圣武士都献身于守序和善良的神，并将其的信条视作奉献的标准。他们将善良阵营的完美侍从天使视作其典范，并在头盔或盾徽上饰以天使羽翼的形象。</p><h4>奉献之信条</h4><p>尽管对奉献之誓的精确定义和要求有许多不同的说法，但立下此誓言的圣武士都赞成以下信条。</p><p><strong>诚实。</strong> 不诳语不欺骗，言出必行。</p><p><strong>勇敢。</strong> 谨慎深思，并无畏躬行。</p><p><strong>怜悯。</strong> 援助他人，行锄强扶弱。宽恕敌人，并用心感化。</p><p><strong>荣誉。</strong> 公平待人，躬行荣誉为世人树立典范。力行善举，避免造成不必要的伤害。</p><p><strong>责任。</strong> 服从上级，为自己的行为与表现尽责，为所护卫之人尽责。</p><h4>圣誓法术</h4><p>你获得以下圣誓法术。</p><table><caption>奉献圣誓法术</caption><thead><tr><td>圣武士等级</td><td>法术</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3rd</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.xmDBqZhRVrtLP8h2]{防护善恶}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.gvdA9nPuWLck4tBl]{庇护术}</td></tr><tr><td>5th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.F0GsG0SJzsIOacwV]{次等复原术}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.CylBa7jR8DSbo8Z3]{诚实之域}</td></tr><tr><td>9th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.ZU9d6woBdUP8pIPt]{希望信标}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.15Fa6q1nH27XfbR8]{解除魔法}</td></tr><tr><td>13th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.da0a1t2FqaTjRZGT]{行动自如}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.TgHsuhNasPbhu8MO]{信仰守卫}</td></tr><tr><td>17th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.d54VDyFulD9xxY7J]{通神术}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.5e1xTohkzqFqbYH4]{焰击术}</td></tr></tbody></table>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"identifier":"oath-of-devotion","classIdentifier":"paladin","advancement":[{"_id":"x139gm4ohldqu68j","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.xNN0JMKqlG4hKVYu","optional":false},{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.ZdwGlsJNtc7pGFCd","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":3,"title":"子职业特性"},{"_id":"enzzft6q7timpcg1","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.M2DxVsgLeZgXOznT","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":7,"title":"子职业特性"},{"_id":"lnfks5j00ywstged","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.ZHJyYrqMYSLub4RY","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":15,"title":"子职业特性"},{"_id":"5a99kkfabklcl06a","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.ANE5gjojvhNEagzz","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":20,"title":"子职业特性"}],"spellcasting":{"progression":"none","ability":"","preparation":{}}},"effects":[],"folder":"HwOKB9LPw4dA10L8","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"zzzz","m":"id"}},"_id":"sZ86mbX8D5PfYuhl","_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.344","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"4.0.0","createdTime":1725037372993,"modifiedTime":1725992730670,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"name":"狂战士道途 Path of the Berserker","type":"subclass","img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>某些野蛮人认为狂暴即是其归宿，而这种归宿形式无比残暴。狂战士之道追求鲜血与无拘的狂怒。当你进入狂战士式狂暴时，你在战斗的混沌快感中兴奋，舍生忘死的投入厮杀。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"identifier":"path-of-the-berserker","classIdentifier":"barbarian","advancement":[{"_id":"79o5gdodki55y2s6","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.CkbbAckeCtyHXEnL","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":3,"title":"子职业特性"},{"_id":"v2wgomyba9p2orht","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.0Jgf8fYY2ExwgQpN","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":6,"title":"子职业特性"},{"_id":"zstkqtiw4rd9jy03","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.M6VSMzVtKPhh8B0i","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":10,"title":"子职业特性"},{"_id":"sngpm2xqk3cv1g3g","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.xzD9zlRP6dUxCtCl","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":14,"title":"子职业特性"}],"spellcasting":{"progression":"none","ability":"","preparation":{}}},"effects":[],"folder":"ZTP0KiGOdRqUKVvZ","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"zzzz","m":"id"}},"_id":"uGuDQX9Mz3oHNHkU","_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.344","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"4.0.0","createdTime":1725037373053,"modifiedTime":1725992730698,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"name":"塑能学派 School of Evocation","type":"subclass","img":"icons/magic/fire/beam-strike-whip-red.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>你专注于研习以魔力创造威力惊人的元素力量，诸如：苦寒、灼焰、惊雷、汲电、烈酸。一些塑能师会接受军队的雇佣，在军队的后方作为在远距离轰炸敌人的“重炮手”。另一些则以其惊人力量四处保护弱小，或是仅仅为满足自身而成为强盗、冒险家、甚至野心勃勃的暴君。</p>","chat":""},"source":{"custom":"","book":"","page":"","license":"CC-BY-4.0","rules":"2014"},"identifier":"school-of-evocation","classIdentifier":"wizard","advancement":[{"_id":"qgi9q6koa7jabbc5","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.7uzJ2JkmsdRGLra3","optional":false},{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.6VBXkjjBgjSpNElh","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":2,"title":"子职业特性"},{"_id":"j1twu5y6jafoeupk","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.evEWCpE5MYgr5RRW","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":6,"title":"子职业特性"},{"_id":"vlybc408acscngpd","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.7O85kj6uDEG5NzUE","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":10,"title":"子职业特性"},{"_id":"s82u4bepkgu04upt","type":"ItemGrant","configuration":{"items":[{"uuid":"Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.VUtSLeCzFubGXmGx","optional":false}],"optional":false,"spell":{"ability":[],"preparation":"","uses":{"max":"","per":""}}},"value":{},"level":14,"title":"子职业特性"}],"spellcasting":{"progression":"none","ability":"","preparation":{}}},"effects":[],"folder":"3qVfhjOhDkOVvfoG","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"mtzh":{"s":"zzzz","m":"id"}},"_id":"Ye5f3FReEnuXfi0y","_stats":{"duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.344","systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"4.0.0","createdTime":1725037372944,"modifiedTime":1725992730647,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000","exportSource":null}},{"name":"邪魔 The Fiend","type":"subclass","img":"icons/magic/control/fear-fright-monster-grin-red-orange.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>你与某位下层位面的邪魔缔结了契约。这些存在抱有邪恶的企图，但你不一定愿意与之同流合污。邪魔们追求着世间万物的堕落与毁灭，而这连你本身也无法独善其身最终。那些强大到能与凡人缔结契约的邪魔包括有狄摩高根Demogorgon、奥喀斯Orcus、弗拉兹厄鲁Fraz-Urb’luu和巴弗灭Baphomet这样的恶魔领主；阿斯蒙蒂斯Asmodeus、迪斯帕特Dispater、墨菲斯托费利斯Mephistopheles和彼列Belial这样的大魔鬼；一些特别强大的深狱炼魔和巴洛炎魔；以及奥法罗斯魔与其他尤格罗斯魔领主。</p><h4>扩展法术列表</h4><p>邪魔让你在学习邪术师法术时可从扩展法术列表中选择。以下法术将被加入你的邪术师法术列表。</p><table><caption>邪魔宗主扩展法术</caption><thead><tr><td>法术环阶</td><td>法术</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1st</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.5SuJewoa1CRWaj1F]{燃烧之手}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.arzCrMRgcNiQuh43]{命令术}</td></tr><tr><td>2nd</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.zwGsAv6kmwzYGhh3]{目盲术/耳聋术}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.7u2obDvuvtZBkTfq]{灼热射线}</td></tr><tr><td>3rd</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.ztgcdrWPshKRpFd0]{火球术}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.TwlD4PLcltv7Xh7j]{臭云术}</td>